<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
		<title>OnlyBaby – Baby &amp; Mum Log</title>
		<meta
			name="description"
			content="OnlyBaby: track baby logs, contractions, and pump sessions with widgets and Live Activity."
		/>
		<style>
			:root {
				color-scheme: light dark;
				--bg: #0b1020;
				--card: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
				--text: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
				--muted: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
				--link: #7dd3fc;
				--border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
			}

			@media (prefers-color-scheme: light) {
				:root {
					--bg: #f7f8fb;
					--card: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
					--text: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88);
					--muted: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.62);
					--link: #2563eb;
					--border: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
				}
			}

			body {
				margin: 0;
				font: 16px/1.55 ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica,
					Arial, sans-serif;
				background:
					radial-gradient(1200px 700px at 15% 0%, rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.22), transparent 60%),
					radial-gradient(1200px 700px at 85% 20%, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.22), transparent 60%),
					var(--bg);
				color: var(--text);
			}

			.container {
				max-width: 860px;
				margin: 0 auto;
				padding: 44px 20px 64px;
			}

			.card {
				padding: 20px;
				border: 1px solid var(--border);
				border-radius: 16px;
				background: var(--card);
				backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
			}

			h1 {
				margin: 0 0 10px;
				font-size: 34px;
				line-height: 1.2;
				letter-spacing: -0.02em;
			}

			p {
				margin: 0;
				color: var(--muted);
			}

			h2 {
				margin: 24px 0 10px;
				font-size: 18px;
				font-weight: 600;
				letter-spacing: -0.01em;
			}

			h2:first-of-type {
				margin-top: 0;
			}

			ul {
				margin: 0;
				padding-left: 20px;
				color: var(--muted);
				line-height: 1.6;
			}

			.links {
				display: flex;
				flex-wrap: wrap;
				gap: 12px;
				margin-top: 18px;
			}

			a {
				color: var(--link);
				text-decoration: none;
			}

			a:hover {
				text-decoration: underline;
			}

			.pill {
				display: inline-flex;
				align-items: center;
				padding: 10px 12px;
				border: 1px solid var(--border);
				border-radius: 999px;
				background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
			}

			footer {
				margin-top: 16px;
				font-size: 13px;
				color: var(--muted);
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<main class="container">
			<section class="card">
				<h1>OnlyBaby</h1>
				<p>
					One place to log baby care and mum care: diaper changes, feeding, breast feeding,
					contractions, and pumping. Home Screen widgets and Lock Screen Live Activity keep key
					information at a glance.
				</p>

				<h2>Baby Log</h2>
				<ul>
					<li>Diaper changes, bottle feeding, and breast feeding</li>
					<li>History, averages, and statistics</li>
					<li>Export and share logs</li>
				</ul>

				<h2>Mum Log</h2>
				<ul>
					<li>Contractions with Lock Screen Live Activity</li>
					<li>Pump sessions, volume tracking, and statistics</li>
					<li>Export and share contractions and pump data</li>
				</ul>

				<h2>Widgets &amp; Settings</h2>
				<ul>
					<li>Milk feeding, diaper, and combined Baby Log widgets</li>
					<li>System, English, Simplified Chinese, and German language options</li>
					<li>Baby birthday settings</li>
				</ul>

				<div class="links">
					<a
						class="pill"
						href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/onlybaby-baby-tracker/id6758526534"
						target="_blank"
						rel="noreferrer"
					>
						Download on the App Store
					</a>
					<a class="pill" href="/onlybaby/privacy.html" rel="nofollow">Privacy Policy</a>
				</div>

				<footer>Last updated: 2026-02-02</footer>
			</section>
		</main>
	</body>
</html>
